# Barbershop Booking System Rules

## Business Logic

### Booking Constraints

- Bookings must be in the future (no past dates)
- Minimum advance booking: 1 hour (configurable per tenant: `minAdvanceHours`)
- Maximum advance booking: 30 days (configurable: `maxAdvanceDays`)
- Time slots: **40-minute intervals** (`slotDurationMinutes`)
- No double bookings for same barber at same time within same tenant
- All bookings require `tenantId`

### Data Models

Every tenant-scoped record includes `tenantId`. Key models: `Tenant`, `TenantSettings`, `User`, `Booking`, `BlockedSlot`.

### Notifications

- Channel: **ManyChat WhatsApp** (not Twilio)
- Confirmations and reminders via ManyChat flows
- Cron: `/api/cron/reminders` processes all active tenants

## Validation Rules

- Customer name: required, min 2 characters, max 50
- Phone: required, 10 digits (Colombia +57 prefix on server)
- Date/Time: must be within tenant operating hours (`scheduleJson`)
- Barber: must exist, be active, and belong to same tenant

## User Experience

- Show available time slots only
- Cancel URL uses tenant domain: `https://{slug}.tubarber.com/cancelar/{id}`
- Cancellation notice: `cancelNoticeHours` from tenant settings (default 2h)
